<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Glynwed raised at Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Glynwed raised at Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Glynwed Plc was raised to &quot;accumulate&quot; from &quot;neutral&quot; at Merrill Lynch, market sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The brokerage said a consumer recovery was coming through in the UK and this should lead to a housing market recovery which should ultimately be good for Glynwed, sources said.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment. The stock was down 1-1/2p at 355-1/2.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
